    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p>You unlock hydraulic pressure seals and interlocking plates within your frame, rapidly expanding into a hulking siege construct. For 1 minute, your size increases to Large. Your reach increases by 5 feet, and you gain a +2 status bonus to melee damage rolls (or +4 status bonus if you have master proficiency in weapons). You also gain 15 temporary Hit Points that last until the transformation ends.</p>"
